The skills summarize practices in their own words and link to the official
Alibaba Java Coding Guidelines (https://github.com/alibaba/p3c); they do not
reproduce its text.

skills/alibaba-java-guidelines/scripts/p3c-check.sh does not contain any rule
implementation. At run time it downloads and runs p3c-pmd-jdk21 from Maven
Central (https://github.com/loong95/p3c-cmd-jdk21, Apache-2.0), an unofficial
port of the alibaba/p3c rules (Apache-2.0) to PMD 7 and JDK 21.
